  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0300_rival_01",
      "hash": "f88a7cd2bc91bf9a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗚哇～～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0300_rival_02",
      "hash": "f88a7bd2bc91bde7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「啊！嗚哇！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，不得了啦！\\c\\n寶……說……咿呀啊！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0300_dummy_01",
      "hash": "4265395987a06562",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 2]"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0300_rival_03",
      "hash": "f88a7ad2bc91bc34",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「呼……\\n哈……呼……\\c\\n呃……\\c\\n真不像是我的作風。\\n不好意思，我被嚇到昏頭了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0300_rival_04",
      "hash": "f88a79d2bc91ba81",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "聽說在這前面\\n住著一個有名的寶可夢狂熱迷。\\r\\n我想在那裡也許\\r\\n能看到罕見的寶可夢，\\r\\n所以就過去看看了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0300_rival_05",
      "hash": "f88a78d2bc91b8ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "但我卻在那裡看到……\\n我說了[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳可別嚇到！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0300_rival_06",
      "hash": "f88a77d2bc91b71b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我看到的不是那個\\n叫正輝的寶可夢狂熱迷！！\\c\\n而是一隻\\n會說人話的寶可夢！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0300_rival_07",
      "hash": "f88a76d2bc91b568",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗚……太可怕了！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳最好也別靠近那裡！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p01_field_t005",
      "hash": "d1c7a8a879f59444",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 8]"
    },
